        "title": "Oggetti",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 130747,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vediamo gli oggetti. Per iniziare a definire un oggetto, usiamo le parentesi graffe <code>{</code> e <code>}</code>. Lo sai già da JavaScript.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: { };\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130798,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Definiamo gli attributi all'interno dell'oggetto come abbiamo definito i tipi in precedenza. Inizia con il nome, seguito da due punti e dal relativo tipo.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name</code>, seguito da <code>:</code> e infine <code>string</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130799,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Separiamo più attributi con le virgole.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\";\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>,</code>, seguito da <code>age: number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy",
            "id": 130797,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Finora abbiamo definito il tipo dell'oggetto. Ora possiamo assegnare un valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name, person.age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"58\" endIndex=\"71\" /><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"82\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"John 25\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>, seguito da <code>{</code> e poi <code>name: \"John\",</code>, <code>age: 25</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 130748,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dopo aver definito un oggetto, possiamo interagirci proprio come faremmo usando JavaScript. Ad esempio, possiamo accedere alle proprietà dell'oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" personName: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = person.name;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(personName);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"116\" endIndex=\"117\" /><option startIndex=\"117\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"John\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>.</code>, seguito da <code>name</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 130749,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Allo stesso modo, puoi anche modificare le proprietà degli oggetti. Prova a modificare la proprietà <code>name</code> dell'oggetto <code>person</code> in \"Jane\".</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;John&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"25\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"person.name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"85\" endIndex=\"91\" /><option startIndex=\"91\" endIndex=\"92\" /><option startIndex=\"92\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"98\" /><option startIndex=\"99\" endIndex=\"105\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\".\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Jane\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>person</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e poi <code>name</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>\"Jane\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 130750,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo anche avere tipi più complessi all'interno di un oggetto. Aggiungiamo un array di numeri.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"44\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"string\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>number</code>, seguito da <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8 - Copy",
            "id": 131282,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Naturalmente, con gli oggetti possiamo anche assegnare direttamente un valore.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"is\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 131283,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Se assegniamo subito un valore, TypeScript dedurrà il tipo. La deduzione dei tipi funziona anche per tipi più complessi, come il nostro tipo oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(player.scores);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 130751,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando accediamo a un array da un oggetto, possiamo anche salvarlo in una variabile.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" player: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"player = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Lee&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" scores: [\" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" scores: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[] = player.scores;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(scores);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"129\" endIndex=\"135\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"[1, 2, 3]\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>scores</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8 - Copy",
            "id": 130802,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Un attributo del nostro oggetto può contenere diversi tipi. Prova a supportare sia i tipi <code>number</code> che <code>string</code> per l'attributo <code>content</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" message: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" content: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"message = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" content: \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(message.content);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"32\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"40\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"||\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>|</code>, seguito da <code>number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7 - Copy",
            "id": 130774,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Completa il tipo di oggetto.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" game: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" players: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"game = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Chess&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" players: \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(game.name, game.players);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"35\" /><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"number\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"10\" endIndex=\"11\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Chess 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>{</code>, seguito da <code>string</code> e poi <code>players</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 130801,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Possiamo usare i tipi unione per gli attributi di un oggetto in TypeScript?<br /><br /></p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Sì, gli attributi possono avere tipi unione</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">No, gli attributi possono avere un solo tipo</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Sì, gli attributi possono avere tipi unione.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6 - Copy",
            "id": 130776,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Accedi a <code>year</code> dell'oggetto <code>car</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" car: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" brand: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" year: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"car = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" brand: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Porsche&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" year: \" /><text value=\"1972\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" year: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" = car.year;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(year);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"107\" endIndex=\"110\" /><option startIndex=\"110\" endIndex=\"111\" /><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"brand\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1972\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>car</code>, seguito da <code>.</code> e infine <code>year</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5 - Copy - Copy",
            "id": 130800,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Scegli il tipo di oggetto corretto per far funzionare il codice.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" person: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"} = {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" name: \" /><text value=\"&quot;Karen&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\",\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" age: \" /><text value=\"33\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.name);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(person.age);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"name = string\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"age = number\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Karen\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"33\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Assicurati di scegliere <code>name: string,</code>, seguito da <code>age: number</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 130803,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quale valore possiamo assegnare all'attributo nell'oggetto <code>animal</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" animal: {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" species: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\" | \" /><text value=\"number\" class=\"built_in\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\">Solo string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\">String o numero</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">String o numero.</p></body></html>"
